-*   Photon beam power $\Phi_b$ entering the medium.
-*   Medium scattering coefficient $\sigma_s$ and extinction coefficient $\sigma_t$.
-*   Uniform step size $\Delta t$.
-*   Random offset $\xi$ for the beam.
